  m_text: 'How To Play:


    -- Click the tower type you wish to place from the
    menu


    -- Place the tower on an open plots of land (brown squares)


    --
    You cannot place towers on plots of land covered by the smog


    -- Each tower
    can be upgraded once by clicking on an already placed tower and choosing which
    upgrade


    -- Successfully defend Gaia from the invaders!'
